"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m027-0306","start":306,"end":308,"surface":"無知","kind":"person","person_id":"1hf_1k0_bnj_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-032-qi","book_id":"b-shiji-032","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-032-qi"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p038","text":"十八年春，公將有行，遂與夫人如齊。申繻諫止，公不聽，遂如齊。齊襄公通桓公夫人。公怒夫人，夫人以告齊矦。夏四月丙子，齊襄公饗公，公醉，使公子彭生抱魯桓公，因命彭生摺其脅，公死于車。魯人告于齊曰：『寡君畏君之威，不敢寧居，來修好禮。禮成而不反，無所歸咎，請得彭生除丑於諸矦。』齊人殺彭生以說魯。立太子同，是爲莊公。莊公母夫人因留齊，不敢歸魯。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m038-0005","start":5,"end":6,"surface":"公","kind":"person","person_id":"lc6_cup_v9c_AB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m038-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"夫人","kind":"person","person_id":"z16_hit_u7t","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m038-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"申繻","kind":"person","person_id":"gft_rfa_1uq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m038-0022","start":22,"end":23,"surface":"公","kind":"person","person_id":"lc6_cup_v9c_AB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m038-0030","start":30,"end":33,"surface":"齊襄公","kind":"person","person_id":"qj2_k5a_sq4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m038-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"lc6_cup_v9c_AB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m038-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"夫人","kind":"person","person_id":"z16_hit_u7t","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m038-0039","start":39,"end":40,"surface":"公","kind":"person","person_id":"lc6_cup_v9c_AB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m038-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"夫人","kind":"person","person_id":"z16_hit_u7t","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m038-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"夫人","kind":"person","person_id":"z16_hit_u7t","status":"contextual_