氏稱、未定官稱或未解指代；不補姓名、成員與父系。"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m038-0136","start":136,"end":138,"surface":"齊人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未指名者、地點氏稱、未定官稱或未解指代；不補姓名、成員與父系。"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m038-0139","start":139,"end":141,"surface":"彭生","kind":"person","person_id":"wxj_wmw_39e","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m038-0146","start":146,"end":149,"surface":"太子同","kind":"person","person_id":"x50_1p7_qkk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m038-0152","start":152,"end":154,"surface":"莊公","kind":"person","person_id":"x50_1p7_qkk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m038-0155","start":155,"end":157,"surface":"莊公","kind":"person","person_id":"x50_1p7_qkk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m038-0158","start":158,"end":160,"surface":"夫人","kind":"person","person_id":"z16_hit_u7t","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu","book_id":"b-shiji-033","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-033-lu"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:p012","text":"子亹元年七月，齊襄公會諸侯於首止，鄭子亹往會，髙渠彌相，從，祭仲稱疾不行。所以然者，子亹自齊襄公爲公子之時，嘗會鬬，相仇，及會諸侯，祭仲請子亹無行。子亹曰：「齊彊，而厲公居櫟，卽不往，是率諸侯伐我，内厲公。我不如往，往何遽必辱，且又何至是！」卒行。於是祭仲恐齊并殺之，故稱疾。子亹至，不謝齊侯，齊侯怒，遂伏甲而殺子亹。髙渠彌亡歸，歸與祭仲謀，召子亹弟公子嬰於陳而立之，是爲鄭子。是歳，齊襄公使彭生醉拉殺魯桓公。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m012-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"子亹","kind":"person","person_id":"5zd_tsn_2xr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m012-0007","start":7,"end":10,"surface":"齊襄公","kind":"person","person_id":"k8n_rwt_70b","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m012-0017","start":17,"end":20,"surface":"鄭子亹","kind":"person","person_id":"5zd_tsn_2xr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m012-0023","start":23,"end":26,"surface":"髙渠彌","kind":"person","person_id":"f23_b0p_hqg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-042-zheng:m01